<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        Your <a href="/account/manage">account page</a> opens from your name at the bottom of the menu. Each
        section saves on its own.
    </FluentText>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Your Details</strong>: your first and last name, and <strong>Prefer 24-Hour Format for Time
            Display</strong>. Your user name is shown but can't be changed. You can sign in with it or with
            your email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Details</strong>: your email address, which is where invites, password resets and
            notifications go.</li>
        <li><strong>Home Screen</strong>: choose a dashboard to show when you open Lanyard instead of the standard
            home page, or go back with <strong>Use the standard home page</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>Clock-in PIN</strong>: the 4 to 6 digit PIN you type on the clock-in tablet. Shown when your
            company uses staff scheduling.</li>
        <li><strong>Shift Calendar</strong>: a link that puts your shifts in Google, Apple or Outlook calendar.</li>
    </ul>
</HelpTab>
